      "updated": 1795163114423,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q1. Operational vs programmer errors",
      "originalText": "Q1. Operational vs programmer errors",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 172,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 140.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 889509,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 686840797,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795163114423,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Your AppError sets statusCode and is meant for expected failures\n(wrong password, missing user). A route can also crash with a bug.\nBoth reach errorMiddleware:\n\na) How should the middleware tell an AppError apart from a bug?\nb) What should the client receive for a bug in production, and\n    what must never be sent to the client?",
      "originalText": "Your AppError sets statusCode and is meant for expected failures\n(wrong password, missing user). A route can also crash with a bug.\nBoth reach errorMiddleware:\n\na) How should the middleware tell an AppError apart from a bug?\nb) What should the client receive for a bug in production, and\n    what must never be sent to the client?",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 336,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 192.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 392924,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 435693360,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795163114423,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "class AppError extends Error {\n  constructor(message, statusCode) {\n    super(message)\n    this.statusCode = statusCode\n    this.isOperational = true\n  }\n}\n\n// somewhere in a route:\nconst user = null\nres.json({ name: user.name })   // TypeError",
      "originalText": "class AppError extends Error {\n  constructor(message, statusCode) {\n    super(message)\n    this.statusCode = statusCode\n    this.isOperational = true\n  }\n}\n\n// somewhere in a route:\nconst user = null\nres.json({ name: user.name })   // TypeError",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "p7",
      "type": "text",
