      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q2. Malformed JSON from the client",
      "originalText": "Q2. Malformed JSON from the client",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "p10",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 672,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 140.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 706474,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 898513284,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795163114423,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A client sends POST /api/notes with body: {name: 'x'} (invalid JSON).\nexpress.json() throws before your route runs. Your error middleware\nis registered after the routes, as usual.\n\na) Which status code does the client receive right now, and why?\nb) Write the check inside errorMiddleware that returns 400 for\n    body-parser errors and keeps the rest of the logic unchanged.",
      "originalText": "A client sends POST /api/notes with body: {name: 'x'} (invalid JSON).\nexpress.json() throws before your route runs. Your error middleware\nis registered after the routes, as usual.\n\na) Which status code does the client receive right now, and why?\nb) Write the check inside errorMiddleware that returns 400 for\n    body-parser errors and keeps the rest of the logic unchanged.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "p12",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 836,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 122.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 440191,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 302706596,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795163114423,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "app.use(express.json())\napp.use('/api/notes', notesRouter)\napp.use(errorMiddleware)\n\n// err from express.json() has:\n//   err.type === 'entity.parse.failed'\n//   err.status === 400",
      "originalText": "app.use(express.json())\napp.use('/api/notes', notesRouter)\napp.use(errorMiddleware)\n\n// err from express.json() has:\n//   err.type === 'entity.parse.failed'\n//   err.status === 400",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
